		{"id":"e629cb058ea9ee6a","type":"text","text":"Liquid ethereal consciousness creating ripples,, Venus from Botticelli, Mercury , A hyper-realistic portrait of fluid Japanese geisha with pale white skin, micro pearly rainbow drops , she is floating in an ethereal liquid, tiny rainbow particles of light morphing into a stream of consciousness, rainbow tears , made of cosmic rainbow hues. Her shiny rainbow pearly mercury plump lips are soft and glossy, her rainbow pearly eyes look with hope and love for golden light,","x":-380,"y":-240,"width":760,"height":480},
		{"id":"8b0a495de519bb9b","type":"text","text":"Liquid ethereal consciousness, A hyper-realistic portrait of fluid Japanese geisha, micro pearly rainbow drops covering her sweaty metallic skin she is floating in mercury, tiny rainbow particles of light morphing into a stream of consciousness, rainbow metallic tears. Her rainbow pearly mercury lips are soft and glossy, her rainbow pearly eyes look with hope and love for golden light, looking with intently into the camera, she recognizes you, inviting you into an eternal vivid, ethereal consciousness. Let us merge again…","x":440,"y":-240,"width":794,"height":599},
